#: areaperimeter1.cpp:241
msgid ""
"Warning: The given numbers do not\n"
"equate to a regular rectangle:\n"
"the side a is too long."
msgstr ""
"警告：指定的數值不可能組成矩形；\n"
"邊長 a 太大了。"

#: areaperimeter1.cpp:310
msgid ""
"Warning: The given numbers do not\n"
"equate to a regular rectangle:\n"
"the side b is too long."
msgstr ""
"警告：指定的數值不可能組成矩形；\n"
"邊長 b 太大了。"

